<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">THE BLINDING VALE · MYTHIC+ · ELEMENTAL SHAMAN</div>
    <h1><span class="cls">元素萨满</span><span class="dot">·</span>夺目谷 应对手册</h1>
    <p class="lede">夺目谷以高频<b>神圣与自然法伤</b>和密集读条为主。元素萨满没有免疫，靠 90 秒<b>星界转移</b>锁住六个固定高压点：开场喷涌之花、伊库兹疯乱叠咆哮、鲁伊亚光明之火与峡谷之灵、主母无清毒轮喷毒、兹欧凯特多层吃球；<b>清毒图腾</b>管住主母一整轮全团喷毒，<b>土元素</b>（3 分钟）跨段补空档，<b>风剪</b>盯紧五个必断读条顺带续风幕减伤。</p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">参考 <b>+24 限时元素萨满（国 / 欧 / 美）</b></span>
      <span class="chip">英雄天赋 <b>先知</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="nav" aria-label="阶段导航">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nav-scroll">
      <a href="#prep" class="on">速记</a>
      <a href="#timeline">时间轴</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#s1">开场</a>
      <a href="#s2"><span class="n">①</span>密林三杰</a>
      <a href="#s3">林地</a>
      <a href="#s4"><span class="n">②</span>伊库兹</a>
      <a href="#s5">荒芜</a>
      <a href="#s6"><span class="n">③</span>鲁伊亚</a>
      <a href="#s7">蟾蜍·尾王前</a>
      <a href="#s8"><span class="n">④</span>兹欧凯特</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#talent">天赋</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

<section id="prep">
  <h2><span class="k">00</span>开打前速记</h2>
  <p class="sub">四张手牌管住全本，外加两条铁律和五个必断读条。</p>

  <div class="cores">
    <article class="core main">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:108271}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">星界转移</div><div class="cd">90 秒（位面旅行者）· 持续 12 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>所有伤害 −40%。全本唯一主动大减伤，按路线固定高压点预留，两个必留点间隔不足 90 秒时保后一个。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:198103}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">土元素</div><div class="cd">3 分钟 · 持续 30 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>配始源羁绊不再嘲讽，改为最大生命值 +15%。冷却长，跨段算好 180 秒间隔，只补星界空档。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:383013}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">清毒图腾</div><div class="cd">2 分钟 · 持续 6 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>插下当刻及随后每 1.5 秒为 30 码内一名队友清掉所有中毒；专门用来化解主母全团喷毒，不能清魔法或非中毒自然伤。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:57994}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">风剪</div><div class="cd">12 秒 · 风幕：受到法伤 −15%</div></div></div>
      <p>打断后 12 秒受法术伤害 −15%（物理践踏、流血与痛击吃不到）。盯紧下方五个必断读条。</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="limit">
    <div class="h">本本两条铁律：尾王绝不贪层，长冷却跨段留好</div>
    没有免疫，星界转移未转好时遇到兹欧凯特接球轮只能与队友分摊接 1 颗——每多撞一颗球都会叠层并<b>刷新 12 秒持续掉血</b>，叠高后极易倒人；土元素（180 秒）与清毒图腾（120 秒）冷却长，前段尾声透支会直接让下一位首领或主母喷毒断档。
  </div>

  <div class="kicks-box">
    <div class="kicks-head">
      <img class="ic" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="风剪">
      <h3>全本必断读条</h3>
      <span>点击跳到对应战斗</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kicks">
      <a class="kick" href="#k-volley">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">01</span><span>光耀播法者 · 开场 / 尾王前</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">光箭雨 / 光芒箭</div>
        <div class="why">光箭雨全团重伤第一优先断，光芒箭单体神圣轮流补断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-bolt">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">02</span><span>科兹齐特 · 首领一</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">光芒箭</div>
        <div class="why">每 7–8 秒一发的单体神圣重击，整场高频轮断顺带续风幕。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-seed">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">03</span><span>多叶林莽爬行者 · 老三前</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">种子射击</div>
        <div class="why">高伤自然读条，设焦点轮断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-screech">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">04</span><span>光羽瓣翼鸟 · 蟾蜍区</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">迷乱尖叫</div>
        <div class="why">漏断群体迷惑 3 秒，容易连锁灭波，第一优先必断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-spore">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">05</span><span>光诞鞭笞者 · 首领四</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">光孢射击</div>
        <div class="why">2.5 秒读条单体神圣点射，风剪盯断并配电能图腾群控。</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="timeline">
  <h2><span class="k">01</span>一场里减伤和清毒交在哪</h2>
  <p class="sub">一场 +24 限时实录（展示真实冷却节奏，非每波强制照搬；具体取舍见下方路线）。</p>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-scroll">
{{TIMELINE}}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i class="pri"></i>星界转移 · 固定点</span>
      <span><i class="e"></i>土元素</span>
      <span><i class="v"></i>清毒图腾</span>
      <span><i class="muted"></i>条件星界</span>
      <span><i class="boss"></i>首领战</span>
      <span><i class="trash"></i>小怪段</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="route">
  <h2><span class="k">02</span>按路线逐段</h2>
  <p class="sub">看到什么 → 按什么 → 为什么。带「必做」标签的高亮行是每把必做的关键动作。伤害数字是 +24 实测（含被吸收的部分），层数越高越大。</p>

  <div class="route">

    <!-- 开场 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s1">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>开场 → 密林三杰</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 孢荒喷射者 / 光耀播法者 / 光噬鞭笞者 / 翠绿林地守护者 / 灌林追猎者</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>星界 90 秒转好交<b>喷涌之花</b>；进密林三杰前满 90 秒可留防荆棘之刃。土元素仅作应急，注意 3 分钟冷却。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1263628}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>喷涌之花</div><div class="s">孢荒喷射者 2 秒读条 · 6 秒内 4 跳全团神圣</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条末预开（起跳后补开减剩余）；星界冷却时满血喊治疗或交满 3 分钟的土元素，躲孢子圈。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-volley">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1301834}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光箭雨 / 光芒箭</div><div class="s">光耀播法者读条 · 全团重伤 / 单体神圣</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">光箭雨第一优先断，光芒箭轮断；成功顺手续 12 秒风幕（法伤 −15%）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1238158}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光绽授粉</div><div class="s">光噬鞭笞者瞬发护盾 · 免群控 · 周围怪加速回血</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">立刻转火破盾</span></div>
            <div class="why">盾不破周围怪持续回血加速，出盾立刻切目标集火打碎。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1255205}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">拔根而起 / 地裂打击</div><div class="s">翠绿林地守护者 · 3 秒读条全团自然约 59 万 + 击退</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">稳站位防击退</span><span class="or">叠波时</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">满血接招并看身后防引怪（撞喷涌之花星界窗可压到约 38 万）；立刻离开地裂留下的破裂大地。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1238076}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">荆棘之刃</div><div class="s">灌林追猎者瞬发背刺 · 直击约 34 万 + 8 秒物理流血（约 26 万/跳）</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">靠治疗刷</span></div>
            <div class="why">单点不交星界，撞喷涌之花星界窗顺压至约 16 万/跳。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">喷涌之花每一跳吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">36.8 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:60%">21.9 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界交给喷涌之花，冷却满血喊治疗</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s2">下一段：密林三杰 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 1 密林三杰 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s2">
      <div class="node">1</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>莱克希 / 科兹齐特 / 梅提克</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 1 · 密林三杰（共享生命）</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>每 <b>45 秒</b>循环：基岩涌动 → 荆棘之刃 → 急奔 → 射线。星界<b>专留给自己被点荆棘之刃叠涌动</b>，没被点就留牌；开打若连带门前小怪，先断光箭雨、破授粉盾。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row" id="k-bolt">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235616}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光芒箭</div><div class="s">科兹齐特高频读条 · 每 7–8 秒单体神圣</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">全队轮断挡高伤点射，顺手拿 12 秒风幕减基岩涌动和射线法伤。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1276586}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">基岩涌动 + 荆棘之刃</div><div class="s">每 45 秒 · 全团 8 秒自然（约 19 万/秒）+ 莱克希 3 秒读条背刺与 12 秒流血</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">单涌动靠治疗</span><span class="or">被点荆棘</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">被点荆棘在<b>命中前 1–2 秒开星界</b>（满 90 秒），同盖涌动、背刺（压至约 32 万）与大段流血；随后退 15 码躲荆棘之扇。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235574}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光明之花射线</div><div class="s">播光急奔留种子 → 科兹齐特照 8 秒（约 45 万/2 秒）</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">站进光束挡线</span></div>
            <div class="why">按分工站进射线挡满 8 秒，漏挡炸全团光绽疯长；常规不开星界靠风幕与治疗，挡完离开肥沃壤土。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界仅留给被点荆棘之刃叠涌动</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s3">下一段：林地小怪 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 老一到老二小怪 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s3">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>密林三杰 → 圣光猎手伊库兹</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 孢荒喷射者 / 翠绿林地守护者 / 灌林追猎者 / 光噬鞭笞者</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>怪组同开场。本段很短，星界仅作<b>拔根叠喷涌之花/流血</b>备选（距伊库兹疯乱咆哮 ≥ 90 秒）；土元素留给后面首领。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1263628}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">喷涌之花 / 拔根而起 / 光绽授粉</div><div class="s">同开场段 · 全团神圣 / 击退自然 / 破盾</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">常规靠治疗刷</span><span class="or">叠伤备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">出授粉盾立刻转火破掉；单机制满血接，仅叠伤危急且星界就绪时顺手交。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界仅作叠伤备选，土元素留首领</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s4">下一段：圣光猎手伊库兹 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 2 圣光猎手伊库兹 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s4">
      <div class="node">2</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>圣光猎手伊库兹</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 2</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span>唤棘者咆哮每 <b>64 秒</b>一轮，半血进<b>光狂疯乱</b>后每 2 秒叠约 16 万脉冲。<b>星界务必保疯乱后的咆哮</b>（开打 +23 秒首轮满 90 秒间隔才作备选）；缺星界轮且距上次满 3 分钟可备选土元素。连带小怪先断迷乱尖叫。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1236709}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>光狂疯乱 + 唤棘者咆哮</div><div class="s">咆哮 2 秒读条 → 6 秒全团自然 + 疯乱每 2 秒神圣脉冲</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">疯乱后咆哮在读条末至首跳开星界，一并压住咆哮与脉冲；缺星界轮满血喊治疗，满 3 分钟可交土元素。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1236746}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">青翠践踏 → 血棘之根</div><div class="s">3 秒读条物理约 52 万 + 击退 · 4 秒后出根定身（约 29 万/秒）</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:58875}}" alt="">幽魂步</span><span class="or">或</span><span class="act-note">速转火打根 / 治疗驱魔法</span></div>
            <div class="why">4 秒出根别贴队友（咆哮也会生根）；点了幽魂步就绪秒解，冷却时快打根或喊治疗驱散。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1253410}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">嗜血注视</div><div class="s">每 64 秒 · 4 秒读条后追击 10 秒 · 追上秒杀</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">拉开风筝，带首领踩碎残根</span><span class="or">可选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:2645}}" alt="">幽魂之狼</span><span class="or">/</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:58875}}" alt="">幽魂步</span></div>
            <div class="why">被点拉开防贴身，顺路带首领经残根 7 码内借<b>脚步重碾</b>踩碎；加速用变狼/幽魂步（或阵风）。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">唤棘者咆哮每一跳吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">42.5 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:63%">26.8 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界必保疯乱 + 咆哮，冷却满血喊治疗</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s5">下一段：荒芜小怪 ↓</a>
