    <!-- 首领 3 护光者鲁伊亚 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s6">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>护光者鲁伊亚</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3 · 三形态（枭兽 → 熊 → 哈籁尼尔）</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>三形态：<b>P1 枭兽 → P2 熊（约 +90 秒）→ P3 峡谷之灵（约 +165 秒）</b>。星界交 <b>P1 光明之火</b>（距 P3 ≥ 90 秒）与 <b>P3 峡谷之灵</b>；土元素满 3 分钟优先补 P2/P3 痛击。</div>
        <div class="subhead">三阶段应对节奏（以开打为 0 秒）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">P1 枭兽</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1239824}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光明之火 / 守卫之怒</div><div class="s">每 21 秒点 3 人 6 秒光辉（约 26 万/秒）留沉默射线 · 光明坠落 4 码</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">补断守卫之怒</span></div>
            <div class="why">P1 前中段被点立刻开星界（压至约 16 万/秒），结束前贴边放射线别踩进；顺手补断守卫之怒、躲 4 码圈。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">约 +89–108 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1241058}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">P2 熊 · 凶残痛击 / 粉碎打击</div><div class="s">每 21 秒全团物理约 89 万 + 流血至满血（约 12 万/秒）· 3 道锥形</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素（≥ 3 分）</span><span class="act-note">躲开 3 道锥形</span></div>
            <div class="why">流血最长 40 秒、<b>回满血即消</b>；星界留 P3，满 3 分钟交土元素并用治疗之涌帮抬满。躲开 3 道锥形（吃中易伤 100%）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">约 +158–177 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1241067}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>P3 峡谷之灵（幽灵枭兽 + 幽灵熊）</div><div class="s">哈籁尼尔 4 秒读条进场 · 灵体轮放光明之火与凶残痛击 / 粉碎打击</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">未交则补</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why"><b>光明之火上身且痛击将至时开星界</b>，12 秒同压火跳、痛击直击（压至约 58 万）与前段流血（压至约 7 万），随后速抬满清流血；土元素留补下轮痛击。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界交 P1 光明之火 + P3 峡谷之灵（≥ 90 秒）</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s7">下一段：蟾蜍 · 尾王前 ↓</a>
